e displaystyle=\"true\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\" rowspacing=\"0.8em 0.8em 0.8em 0.8em 0.3em\"><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>14</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>≤</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>14</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>7</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-76000-e-1\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-76000-e-1\"></div>\n\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>To find the values of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"51\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> that satisfy both inequalities, we find where the two solutions overlap:</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-76000-e-2\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-76000-e-2\"></div>\n\n<p>Thus, the final solution is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"52\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c cla